## Decisions Made
| Decision | Why | Alternatives Considered |
|----------|-----|------------------------|
| QWidget instead of QFrame for _ProposalCard | Houdini's global QFrame styles intercept mouse events in PySide6 | setAttribute WA_TransparentForMouseEvents (didn't work), QScrollArea removal alone (insufficient) |
| Remove QScrollArea for proposals | Also consumed mouse click events on Windows 11 PySide6 | Keep scroll area with event filter (fragile) |
